@startuml
title Secuencia de busqueda consumida por WordPress
actor Usuario
participant "WordPress\n(futuro bloque/plugin)" as WP
participant "SearchController" as Controller
participant "ContentService" as Service
participant "MongoContentRepositoryAdapter" as Adapter
participant "SpringDataContentRepository" as Repository
database "MongoDB" as Mongo
participant "RelevanceScorer" as Scorer

Usuario -> WP : Introduce palabra clave y filtros
WP -> Controller : GET /api/v1/search?q=...&type=...&page=...&size=...
Controller -> Service : search(SearchQuery, SearchFilters)
Service -> Adapter : findAllVisible()
Adapter -> Repository : findAllByVisibleTrue()
Repository -> Mongo : consulta documentos visibles
Mongo --> Repository : ContentDocument[]
Repository --> Adapter : ContentDocument[]
Adapter --> Service : ContentItem[]
loop Por cada contenido compatible
  Service -> Scorer : score(content, query)
  Scorer --> Service : puntuacion
end
Service -> Service : filtra, ordena y pagina
Service --> Controller : SearchPage
Controller --> WP : SearchResponse JSON\n(items resumidos y score)
WP --> Usuario : Muestra resultados enlazados al detalle
@enduml
